    "description": "Some of life's greatest lessons aren't found in classrooms.\n\nThey emerge through dialogue, philosophy, reflection, and the lived experience of those who've walked the path before us.\n\nThis is JÑĀNA, a Shoonya World series dedicated to the pursuit of deeper understanding.\n\nWhat has been one conversation that changed the way you see life?\n\n#ShoonyaWorld #Jnana #ConsciousLiving\n\nEvery craft has its masters.\n\nJÑĀNA is our invitation to sit with those who've walked the path before us, ask better questions, challenge our perspectives, and discover what can't be learned from information alone.\n\nUnderstanding begins with curiosity.\n\n#ShoonyaWorld #Jnana #LivedExperience\n\nTo us, JÑĀNA is more than knowledge.\n\nIt is understanding shaped by philosophy, reflection, meaningful dialogue, and lived experience.\n\n#ShoonyaWorld #Ranchi",
